The F9K1119v1 has the same FCC ID as the [[http://techinfodepot.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Belkin_F9K1115_v2|F9K1115v2]] (K7SF9K1115V2).

==== F9K1119v1 (AC1600) ====
19.07 factory.bin installs on the F9K1119v1 (tested through 19.07.10).  However, the ath79 builds fail both via GUI and in recovery mode - tested 21.02 and 22.03, both sysupgrade and factory.bin (after OEM reversion).  This issue does not apply to the F9K1115v2 [?].

NOTE: the [[http://techinfodepot.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Belkin_F9K1119_v2|F9K1119v2]] is a Realtek SoC and thus not OpenWRT compatible.

