==== OEM Reversion ====
See [[#recovery]].

==== Recovery ====
NOTE: A WAN input might be required to access the OEM GUI.
  * Either:
    - Plug in power, hold reset as soon as the WPS light comes on until the main LED continuously flashes yellow.
    - If running, hold reset until the main LED is flashing blue, release until it briefly flashes yellow, then hold reset until it continuously flashes yellow.
  * Open 192.168.2.1 in a web browser to access recovery (named "Bootloader Upgrade UI")
  * Load the OEM firmware (OpenWRT 19.07 **factory.bin** does not work for F9K1119v1).
At this point, an OpenWRT **factory.bin** image can be loaded if desired (use 19.07 for F9K1119v1).
